1
00:00:00,120 --> 00:00:03,043
Khabib versus McGregor. The biggest grudge in fighting.

2
00:00:03,293 --> 00:00:04,551
But it didn't start that way.

3
00:00:04,801 --> 00:00:08,727
Khabib, a wrestler from Dagestan in Russia, had never lost a fight.

4
00:00:08,977 --> 00:00:12,433
Conor, from Dublin, Ireland, was the loudest talker in the sport.

5
00:00:12,933 --> 00:00:16,794
Back in 2014, the two swapped friendly messages online.

6
00:00:17,294 --> 00:00:18,830
Then Conor became a superstar.

7
00:00:19,080 --> 00:00:23,667
In 2016, Khabib was unbeaten, and pushing hard for a title shot.

8
00:00:23,917 --> 00:00:26,818
Instead, the big November show in New York went to Conor.

9
00:00:27,068 --> 00:00:29,415
Khabib said he'd been used as a bargaining chip.

10
00:00:29,915 --> 00:00:32,795
Backstage at the weigh-ins, they finally met face to face.

11
00:00:33,045 --> 00:00:34,901
Words flew, and staff pulled them apart.

12
00:00:35,401 --> 00:00:38,601
That night, Conor won the lightweight belt. The one Khabib wanted.

13
00:00:38,851 --> 00:00:42,968
He became the first fighter to hold two of the promotion's belts at the same time.

14
00:00:43,468 --> 00:00:49,911
Later, Conor's friend and training partner, Artem Lobov, criticized Khabib in an interview on Russian TV.

15
00:00:50,161 --> 00:00:51,206
Khabib didn't forget.

16
00:00:51,706 --> 00:00:55,034
In April 2018, he found Lobov in New York.

17
00:00:55,284 --> 00:00:56,713
Part two: the day it exploded.

